WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.233
HIPAA training. Module 9. State laws beside HIPAA.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.233
HIPAA is the floor, not the ceiling.

3
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:14.200
A state law that protects patients more still applies, and the stricter rule wins.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.867
Texas requires new hires to be trained within 90 days.

5
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:26.500
A Texas provider with an electronic record answers a written request within 15 business days.

6
00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:29.967
Signed training statements are kept for six years.

7
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.933
California licensed clinics and hospitals report breaches within 15 business days.

8
00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:42.933
California businesses in general tell affected residents within 30 calendar days.

9
00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:46.033
A licensed clinic can fall under both rules.

10
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.400
Read your client's instructions.

11
00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:52.333
Check which state the client is in.

12
00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:54.400
Follow the stricter rule.

13
00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:56.967
When stuck, ask your lead.

14
00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:58.767
Stop.

15
00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:00.167
Do not share.

16
00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:01.700
Ask your lead.

17
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.833
Now read the module.
